{
  "kind": "html",
  "caption": "从左到右扫描数组，令“当前和”表示必须以当前元素结尾的最大子数组和：若此前累积为负，就从当前元素重新开始，否则继续累加。每一步再用“全局最大和”记录历史最优值；示例最终锁定连续子数组 [4,-1,2,1]，最大和为 6。整个过程只遍历一次数组，时间复杂度为 O(n)，额外空间复杂度为 O(1)。",
  "html": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\">\n<title>最大子数组和演示</title>\n<style>\n*{box-sizing:border-box}html,body{margin:0;background:#1c1c1c;color:#d4d4d4;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,\"PingFang SC\",sans-serif;font-size:12px;line-height:1.45}.app{max-width:560px;margin:0 auto;padding:8px 10px 10px;display:block}.panel{width:100%;background:#252526;border:1px solid #3c3c3c;border-radius:6px;padding:8px 10px;box-shadow:none}h1{font-size:14px;margin:0 0 4px;font-weight:600;color:#d4d4d4}.lead{margin:0 0 6px;color:#8d8d8d;font-size:12px}.array{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(9,38px);gap:4px}.cell{position:relative;min-height:40px;width:38px;border:1px solid #3c3c3c;border-radius:4px;background:#2d2d30;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font:700 12px \"SF Mono\",Monaco,Menlo,monospace;transition:.35s}.cell::after{content:attr(data-i);position:absolute;bottom:2px;font:9px \"SF Mono\",Monaco,Menlo,monospace;color:#8d8d8d}.cell.current{border-color:#3794ff;box-shadow:0 0 0 1px #3794ff}.cell.segment{background:#0e639c;color:#fff;border-color:#3794ff}.cell.best{background:#0e639c;color:#fff;border-color:#3794ff}.metrics{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:6px;margin:6px 0}.card{background:#2d2d30;border:1px solid #3c3c3c;border-radius:6px;padding:6px 8px}.label{font-size:10px;color:#3794ff;margin-bottom:2px}.value{font:700 13px \"SF Mono\",Monaco,Menlo,monospace;color:#3794ff}.explain{min-height:auto;background:#2a2d2e;border-left:3px solid #3794ff;border-radius:0 4px 4px 0;padding:8px 10px;font-size:11px;line-height:1.45}.formula{font-family:\"SF Mono\",Monaco,Menlo,monospace;color:#d4d4d4}.decision{color:#3794ff}.footer{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;margin-top:6px}.bar{height:3px;flex:1;background:#3c3c3c;border-radius:4px;overflow:hidden}.progress{height:100%;width:0;background:#3794ff;transition:width .35s}.step{font:10px \"SF Mono\",Monaco,Menlo,monospace;color:#8d8d8d;white-space:nowrap}\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<main class=\"app\"><section class=\"panel\">\n<h1>一次扫描：保留“值得延续”的前缀</h1>\n<p class=\"lead\">示例 nums = [-2, 1, -3, 4, -1, 2, 1, -5, 4]</p>\n<div class=\"array\" id=\"array\"></div>\n<div class=\"metrics\">\n<div class=\"card\"><div class=\"label\">当前元素</div><div class=\"value\" id=\"num\">-</div></div>\n<div class=\"card\"><div class=\"label\">以当前位置结尾的最大和</div><div class=\"value\" id=\"current\">-</div></div>\n<div class=\"card\"><div class=\"label\">全局最大和</div><div class=\"value\" id=\"best\">-</div></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"explain\" id=\"explain\">准备从左向右扫描……</div>\n<div class=\"footer\"><div class=\"bar\"><div class=\"progress\" id=\"progress\"></div></div><div class=\"step\" id=\"step\">准备</div></div>\n</section></main>\n<script>\nconst nums=[-2,1,-3,4,-1,2,1,-5,4];\nconst box=document.getElementById('array');\nnums.forEach((n,i)=>{const e=document.createElement('div');e.className='cell';e.dataset.i=i;e.textContent=n;box.appendChild(e)});\nconst cells=[...box.children],numEl=document.getElementById('num'),curEl=document.getElementById('current'),bestEl=document.getElementById('best'),expEl=document.getElementById('explain'),prog=document.getElementById('progress'),stepEl=document.getElementById('step');\nlet states=[],cur=0,best=-Infinity,start=0,bestL=0,bestR=0;\nnums.forEach((x,i)=>{const old=cur;let restart=i===0||old<0;if(i===0){cur=x;start=0}else if(restart){cur=x;start=i}else cur=old+x;if(cur>best){best=cur;bestL=start;bestR=i}states.push({i,x,old,cur,best,start,bestL,bestR,restart})});\nlet k=-1,timer;\nfunction render(){cells.forEach(c=>c.className='cell');if(k<0){numEl.textContent=curEl.textContent=bestEl.textContent='-';expEl.innerHTML='准备从左向右扫描：负数累积不会帮助后续子数组，因此可以果断舍弃。';prog.style.width='0%';stepEl.textContent='准备';return}const s=states[k];cells[s.i].classList.add('current');for(let j=s.start;j<=s.i;j++)cells[j].classList.add('segment');numEl.textContent=s.x;curEl.textContent=s.cur;bestEl.textContent=s.best;const choice=s.i===0?'首个元素，直接作为当前和':s.restart?'此前当前和为负，从当前元素重新开始':'此前当前和非负，继续向右延伸';const left=s.i===0?s.x:`max(${s.x}, ${s.old} + ${s.x})`;expEl.innerHTML=`<span class=\"decision\">${choice}</span><br><span class=\"formula\">当前和 = ${left} = ${s.cur}</span><br>全局最大和更新为 <span class=\"formula\">max(历史最优, ${s.cur}) = ${s.best}</span>`;prog.style.width=((k+1)/states.length*100)+'%';stepEl.textContent=`${k+1} / ${states.length}`;if(k===states.length-1){cells.forEach((c,i)=>{c.className='cell';if(i>=s.bestL&&i<=s.bestR)c.classList.add('best')});expEl.innerHTML=`扫描完成。最优区间是下标 <span class=\"formula\">${s.bestL}…${s.bestR}</span>，即 <span class=\"formula\">[${nums.slice(s.bestL,s.bestR+1).join(', ')}]</span>，最大和为 <span class=\"formula\">${s.best}</span>。`}}\nfunction tick(){k++;if(k>=states.length){clearInterval(timer);setTimeout(()=>{k=-1;render();setTimeout(startPlayback,1100)},2200);return}render()}\nfunction startPlayback(){timer=setInterval(tick,1250);tick()}render();setTimeout(startPlayback,900);\n</script>\n</body>\n</html>",
  "svg": "",
  "media": ""
}
